OL,3,GNEWSAActress 'overwhelmed' by honorary
OL,4,Adoctorate
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Mia McKenna-Bruce has said she
OL,7,Ffeels "very lucky and honoured" to have
OL,8,Freceived an honorary doctorate marking
OL,9,Fher career to date.
OL,11,FThe former Maidstone Grammar School for
OL,12,FGirls pupil, who won a Bafta award for
OL,13,Fher role in the 2023 film How to Have
OL,14,FSex, received the honour in a ceremony
OL,15,Fat Canterbury Christ Church University
OL,16,F(CCCU) earlier.
OL,18,FThe university said McKenna-Bruce's had
OL,19,Fhelped to "elevate Kent onto the
OL,20,Fnational stage" during a career which
OL,21,Fbegan as Tee Taylor in the CBBC series
OL,22,FThe Story of Tracey Beaker in 2010.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
